<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>Nepheral: third-party licences</title>
<style>
body { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 60em; margin: 2em auto; padding: 0 1em; line-height: 1.5; }
pre { white-space: pre-wrap; background: #f5f5f5; padding: 1em; font-size: 0.85em; }
li { margin: 0.1em 0; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Third-party licences</h1>
<p>Nepheral's own code is under the Business Source License 1.1 (the
<code>LICENSE</code> file). It is built on the following software, each under
the licence named, whose full text follows. Other notices are in
<code>THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md</code> beside this file.</p>
<h2>Licences</h2>
<ul>
{{#each overview}}
<li><a href="#{{id}}">{{name}}</a> ({{count}})</li>
{{/each}}
</ul>
{{#each licenses}}
<h3 id="{{id}}">{{name}}</h3>
<p>Used by:</p>
<ul>
{{#each used_by}}
<li>{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}</li>
{{/each}}
</ul>
<pre>{{text}}</pre>
{{/each}}
</body>
</html>
